{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>49歲日本寫真女星不破梨衣（ふゎりぃ）罹患胃癌三期，已接受全胃切除手術！日媒近日報導，她抗癌過程相當艱辛，術後曾大量吐血，暴瘦10公斤近況曝光。</p><p>不破梨衣28歲結婚生2子　45歲成為寫真女星</p><p>據日媒報導，不破梨衣20多歲踏入演藝圈，約22歲加入偶像團體，28歲結婚生下2子，因前夫揮霍及婆婆過度干涉而離婚，一度罹患憂鬱（抑鬱）症。</p><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167498253688639488782935.jpeg/-EhBj-K5e9W_9UqFyJUKHnB-bw79RkUa5EnKf-RJyn8\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><p>更多不破梨衣相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499077018062848876319.jpeg/SamNVjOxLRa1mt8xZxFDE-mv1PadKDYle2gzDntoMw4\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499079085985792350682.jpeg/LmlMods7QjQDyzqjIa-yvKEJF6Qt7NPqjg9FOo4PRTo\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣2025年11月健檢竟確診第三期瀰漫型胃癌，最終只能將胃全部切除。（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499076015755264042681.jpeg/1UcF0-bOSIITwd0W3TlbWc7khous8FiPGvGKWRrxilk\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣2025年11月健檢竟確診第三期瀰漫型胃癌，最終只能將胃全部切除。（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣抗癌之路艱辛，她坦言曾出現「像被掐住脖子」的痛苦感受，甚至大量吐血，吐出的血「裝滿一整袋」。（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499078335336448476518.jpeg/j9kRdQKL9bVqjAzcP8htIQia9Oie3B7cm1E14ptRNeI\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣抗癌之路艱辛，她坦言曾出現「像被掐住脖子」的痛苦感受，甚至大量吐血，吐出的血「裝滿一整袋」。（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣積極接受抗癌藥物治療，抗癌期間持續戴假髮、化妝，更把旅行當作撐過治療的動力。（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499080755580928960451.jpeg/ucYxoRJNv8dowXbj1Y5eoiiDtfaDfjRd5BBNxuQQTcY\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣積極接受抗癌藥物治療，抗癌期間持續戴假髮、化妝，更把旅行當作撐過治療的動力。（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499076535717888647398.jpeg/HPVT4eeX7uTCsAQlzCDfHDdy71K8O6b3QvvkTEL75Ew\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499074673315840650974.jpeg/J8z2fdFDzE0TYRlcAT7NuH6E6LA0Af2suiSsnLokrJw\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499071850549248952431.jpeg/KyGbyuyDcVcKrNmK5gq1Jqz51zjReCCPdWJ7GXViexk\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499064376299520185907.jpeg/YOBAbkDQWISGKvIHa2bqo0jX4eq_7ZrPW4FkxVuBZMU\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499074165805056734961.jpeg/WuKiYDiuglmtlWkkepwvZFSBKVx57eNFHRaRpx0Wkac\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499073935249408719623.jpeg/_Ij-0EwFuOKxOMoyhoojB9xLVdG66C5kdLY6f3S2On8\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499066486165504810493.jpeg/Kv_bocyvLt8arG7OLvW2paNjrHYcjN5EoPS8tqD0vLY\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499081397178368230194.jpeg/2UGpWIGa6-YkpzFwB_rWLipaOwDEVXxOst_StrLf0rY\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499068801552384147629.jpeg/KfPNFpInagMowowuQyQ4LTw9IIqC0pBhBbYvzwW2L88\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499070986915840391645.jpeg/kVFnpfLcfK1KUT229VhAMhfcZIvOY1N2Eng3AhJ4NwI\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499073210028032156820.jpeg/9PPxFmix1Wn5TP0nao5M-mkfoJ-5Ht1N8U-f4PFPn-A\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499078851104768325791.jpeg/7r44qg0VZNwzAX70Uty1kBjGW_qhchJI2HvwAth78AI\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499083389603840716230.jpeg/7Z5m2Rskfm-TGz4FcHNrAMBquWl6Yt1s3GHhz9xh4c8\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167499081208434688642130.jpeg/67z5FJydhsVjhp2-qEBfi0nhHuZe9ZzE-7q7ifu6u4k\"/><figcaption>不破梨衣（X@rose_tea_ramb）</figcaption></figure><p>31歲一邊帶孩子，一邊就讀護理學校，34歲取得護理師資格，37歲再婚，直到38歲又重返偶像圈，45歲時則選擇挑戰長年夢想成為寫真女星，2022年推出首部寫真DVD，同時持續擔任護理師，直到2026年6月仍是正職護理師。</p><p>錯過照胃鏡重要時機！女星確診胃癌三期崩潰</p><p>不破梨衣近日接受《文春Online》專訪透露，約2年前出現腹瀉，醫師原以為是工作型態改變造成的壓力所致，但她服藥後卻未改善，之後更出現胃痛情形。她曾被醫師建議照胃鏡，但因距離定期健檢僅剩4個月，認為無須急著檢查而拒絕。</p><p>怎料，去（2025）年11月健檢竟確診第三期瀰漫型胃癌，最終只能將胃全部切除。她事後坦言「相當後悔」，認為若早點照胃鏡，或許能更早發現癌症，甚至可能不用切除整個胃，呼籲民眾若出現腸胃不適，應及早就醫檢查。</p><p>胃全切除！抗癌路艱辛　女星：吐一袋血</p><p>不破梨衣接受全胃切除後，抗癌之路依舊艱辛，她坦言，曾出現「像被掐住脖子」的痛苦感受，甚至大量吐血，吐出的血「裝滿一整袋」。術後她重新適應生活，飲食必須分成一天5至6次，吃完後還可能出現腹痛、腹瀉及倦怠等症狀。抗癌藥物治療期間，她更暴瘦10公斤，體力、食量下降，頭髮大量脫落，連眉毛、睫毛也掉光，讓她一度不願照鏡子，也不想讓家人看到自己的模樣。</p><p>比起死亡　不破梨衣認：害怕臨終前的痛苦</p><p>即使罹患第三期胃癌，不破梨衣不願放棄，「想要保持可愛」的心情，抗癌期間持續戴假髮、化妝，更把旅行當作撐過治療的動力。她曾前往沖繩、神戶、橫濱、伊勢等地，藉此為自己加油。面對瀰漫型胃癌第三期5年存活率不到一半，她坦言，偶爾想到「5年後自己可能已經不在了」，更害怕腹水累積、走向死亡的過程，但比起死亡本身，她更恐懼的是臨終前的痛苦。</p><p>不破梨衣目前積極接受抗癌藥物治療，雖出現味覺障礙，仍會吃能入口的食物，覺得「好吃」就很幸福。她希望未來恢復健康、重返演藝活動，並透過社群鼓勵其他癌症患者。</p><p>【延伸閱讀】馮提莫歷經甲狀腺癌與康復期後重開直播　暴瘦25kg　網民：認不出（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀】馮提莫歷經甲狀腺癌與康復期後重開直播　暴瘦25kg　網民：認不出（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538759493160960682913.jpeg/3lMuRMeeC2dtVnID4BxpJon83u_w9i7uc_q9_XP6vf0\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀】馮提莫歷經甲狀腺癌與康復期後重開直播　暴瘦25kg　網民：認不出（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫在歷經甲狀腺癌與康復期後，近期重回直播，大方展示了減重後留下的「鬆弛皮膚」，表示自己瘦了將近25公斤，真實狀態引發網友熱議。（weibo@馮提莫）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538329618812928036271.jpeg/FPn1QuKYdiRo7a32u2SNmsll3x-jQozRwDaUxsA2lMY\"/><figcaption>馮提莫在歷經甲狀腺癌與康復期後，近期重回直播，大方展示了減重後留下的「鬆弛皮膚」，表示自己瘦了將近25公斤，真實狀態引發網友熱議。（weibo@馮提莫）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538761686913024309627.jpeg/iovKfQ7g6UfdVODjnQjkJoeVMz36sd5EZQXkv2UF5L8\"/><figcaption>馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538763821944832276140.jpeg/tOrYbzQrDJylpn55sGoVNBIxFgZ-9QQEShGk8koRpPI\"/><figcaption>馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538765860507648927053.jpeg/MUkOc6VqKSI80jfON2CNJl9q-X9PYI7aupfZg7qX2YM\"/><figcaption>馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538757421043712785321.jpeg/neXfzjtZSNmULzWV_U6aVIr3SKga8fn3Ql48l0JePJc\"/><figcaption>馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538759677710336821067.jpeg/umvOKmzsbjnjGySp1kwhKwU3PRtMjmE6Qfd910H3fdc\"/><figcaption>馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538761774993408942750.jpeg/OmfF1wX0l3-_q7Kzx_eJpdo0OCCz4lTWEcfVqRHH1ak\"/><figcaption>馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538757408460800154978.jpeg/-w_TLqtdVG2hezPXdZfyG9jJsseV925e2_wmidv8Jok\"/><figcaption>馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538763851304960517840.jpeg/1cprI75VsQLt8RS3Tz-orVuOVjstT0vDCtvqywrb6ss\"/><figcaption>馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538765835341824289650.jpeg/TsX6b7SXSRcd2E7V1JMaoftNeDFkt1kex8kEisfJBIo\"/><figcaption>馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538757202939904509217.jpeg/0ULrrkcln2HtL2zN5QllYylgTyGzeRojkac5m5GnOZs\"/><figcaption>馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538759476383744610853.jpeg/QoIeaV6fEWjaheKACqUOamTJPiigWo4Lmz28sJs9vLA\"/><figcaption>馮提莫直播展示暴瘦近25kg後現況。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538488239394816517486.jpeg/YqBpOWMiqYKKCLOnuXx2_YaogKzH9h9zdp6Cr3aegq8\"/><figcaption>馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538488231006208570193.jpeg/SZeRsZvYN19_uZ95WH3o8WAqt4oZQHskzLRNH8y0TR8\"/><figcaption>馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538490600919040980526.jpeg/rS2hkS8uGpv6M4zNhuU8avugYFiox2kspX9gBqV_YAY\"/><figcaption>馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538485873676288461572.jpeg/LZI2xKv0_hI3pHSwLRWRqcWWXiXO-5_OIB9-ICAffiA\"/><figcaption>馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538483478597632621035.jpeg/1ILL7f3bYmDmAuwDc4s-HUwU5tJQSUW-GlFSnhpRUp4\"/><figcaption>馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538485932396544548701.jpeg/CUKi7yAxbPRdpkGQQ2XSUPJ4D4qLRKQ9T5AbTk-QG04\"/><figcaption>馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260107/1085538481087713280627385.jpeg/rbo7YZWboTk3vhlhj00lgDSHWTlTzrPaJL02kyS9NpM\"/><figcaption>馮提莫（weibo@馮提莫）</figcaption></figure><p>白冰冰昔被黑道圍毆！「頭部遭砍」險喪命　淚憶高凌風、豬哥亮遇槍擊</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T14:39:20.331920+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2135,"images":40,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}